{"id": "section-body-01101", "title": "Approach to Chest Pain", "chapterId": "chapter-one", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "The Concept of Emergency Care and Resuscitation", "Approach to Pain", "Approach to Chest Pain"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-01101", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Approach to Chest Pain", "runs": [{"text": "Approach"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Chest"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Pain"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01102", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The approach to non-traumatic chest pain requires early recognition of life-threatening conditions. Patients with life-threatening conditions may have stable initial vital signs.", "runs": [{"text": "The approach to non-traumatic chest pain requires early recognition of life-threatening conditions. Patients with life-threatening conditions may have stable initial vital signs."}]}, {"id": "body-01103", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "For a patient presenting with chest pain, the following are the differential diagnoses", "runs": [{"text": "For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "presenting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chest"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pain,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "following"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "differential"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnoses"}]}, {"id": "body-01105", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Acute coronary syndrome", "runs": [{"text": "Acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "coronary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01106", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Cardiac tamponade", "runs": [{"text": "Cardiac"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tamponade"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01107", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Pericarditis", "runs": [{"text": "Pericarditis"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01108", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Myocarditis", "runs": [{"text": "Myocarditis"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01109", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Myocardial infarction", "runs": [{"text": "Myocardial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infarction"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01110", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Aortic dissection", "runs": [{"text": "Aortic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dissection"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01111", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Pulmonary embolism", "runs": [{"text": "Pulmonary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "embolism"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01112", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "\nTension pneumothorax", "runs": [{"text": "\n"}, {"text": "Tension"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pneumothorax"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01113", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Acute chest syndrome (sickle cell patients)", "runs": [{"text": "Acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chest"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(sickle"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cell "}, {"text": "patients)"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01114", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Lung infection (pneumonia)", "runs": [{"text": "Lung"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infection"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(pneumonia)"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-01115", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagra